<note xml:id="note-neuro-q" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>NeuroQ</title>

  <p>
      <em>Justification:</em> NeuroQ seems to unify several long-term interests (e.g.,
      statistical mechanics, biophysics, stochastic processes, Scrödinger dynamics, the representation of
      information processed withing and between physical systems).
  </p>
  <p>
      <em>Current Status:</em> Although tempting to jump into it, but not yet actionable. Return to after
      low fidelity physics-informed machine learning project batch is complete.
  </p>


</note>